start
keys ?
keys G
frame bottom
keys gg
frame top
keys G <C-u>
frame page-up
-- config.toml --
show_sidebar = false
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
Buy milk
-- bottom --
┌ [1]─~/todo.txt ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  1   Buy milk                                                                │
│ ┌ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │    :start REFS…  Claims tasks: they are underway and yours               │ │
│ │    :stop REFS…  Ends a claim                                             │ │
│ │    :next [--start]  Shows the task to work on; --start claims it         │ │
│ │Counts                                                                    │ │
│ │  On a motion a count repeats it: 5j moves five rows, 3G goes to task 3.  │ │
│ │  On a task action it takes that many tasks: 3x, 2dd; 2gx opens link 2.   │ │
│ │Mouse                                                                     │ │
│ │  click a row: move the cursor                                            │ │
│ │  click a link in the detail panel: open it                               │ │
│ │  shift-click, drag: select rows                                          │ │
│ │  double-click a row: edit it                                             │ │
│ │  click a panel entry: filter, again to clear                             │ │
│ │  click ▸ ▾: fold or unfold                                               │ │
│ │  click a panel's title or blank space: move the keyboard there           │ │
│ │  click a chip: clear that filter                                         │ │
│ │  click ▶ in doing: show what is being done                               │ │
│ │  wheel: scroll the box under the pointer                                 │ │
